    <string name="root_required_message">This action requests root permission in order to read low-level system data such as kernel logs, partition mount state, and raw hardware sensor values. The data is used only for display inside this app; system files are not modified and nothing is uploaded. Some of this data involves device-unique identifiers. Please confirm that this app came from an official channel (GitHub) and that the source is trustworthy. Continuing means you understand this and accept the related security responsibility.</string>
